<indent=32><sprite=4><indent=48><color=#64F9FA>恢复</color>n点<b>体力</b>\r
<indent=32><sprite=4><indent=48>若n≥200则当回合攻击必定<color=#64F9FA>打出致命一击</color>"""@zh ;
